1. SCOPE
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This license covers the original work created by the Author in this repository:
Outlaw Server's own source code, configuration, build scripts, branding,
artwork, text, and the "Outlaw Server" name (collectively, "the Work").

It does NOT cover third-party components that Outlaw Server bundles, installs,
or depends on (the Linux kernel, Arch packages, Node.js, Docker, Pterodactyl,
Portainer, Cockpit, Tailscale/WireGuard, fonts, etc.). Those remain under their
own respective licenses, and nothing here grants or restricts rights in them
beyond what their licenses say.

